[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2581928891","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101375#issuecomment-2581928891","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101375","id":2581928891,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z5Ru7","user":{"login":"arkology","id":43543909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQzNTQzOTA5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43543909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology","html_url":"https://github.com/arkology","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/arkology/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T07:05:39Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T07:27:15Z","body":"~~Worth to mention that MRP uses double precision floats.~~\nNevermind, it doesn't matter.\nWhat matters is that you have 2 unassigned samplers in \"normal shader\" material. \nSo \"Convert to Shader\" loses sub resources during conversion:\n```\n[sub_resource type=\"FastNoiseLite\" id=\"FastNoiseLite_2h6bs\"]\nnoise_type = 2\n\n[sub_resource type=\"NoiseTexture2D\" id=\"NoiseTexture2D_r7htw\"]\nseamless = true\nnoise = SubResource(\"FastNoiseLite_2h6bs\")\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2581928891/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582147887","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101375#issuecomment-2582147887","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101375","id":2582147887,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z6HMv","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T09:19:18Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T09:19:18Z","body":"CC @godotengine/shaders ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582147887/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582467156","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101375#issuecomment-2582467156","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101375","id":2582467156,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z7VJU","user":{"login":"QbieShay","id":7917475,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5MTc0NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7917475?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay","html_url":"https://github.com/QbieShay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QbieShay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T11:16:35Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T11:16:35Z","body":"If i had to make a guess, there's an inbetween moment where no valid shader is assigned, the uniforms are no longer present, therefore all the variables removed. It's just a guess the issue may be something else.\n\nI forgot to report this, but editing a shader with instance uniforms with an open scene also causes all the instance uniforms to reset. May be the same problem.\n\nPerhaps @Chaosus, @KoBeWi or @Calinou have an idea of the exact process that causes a shader to be recompiled then the inspectors/editors to be updated, and properties being erased as a result of a skipped frame (I would imagine shaders are compiled on the GPU, therefore in an async way, possibly causing some frames with invalid shaders?)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582467156/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582688830","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101375#issuecomment-2582688830","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101375","id":2582688830,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z8LQ-","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T13:13:53Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T13:13:53Z","body":"Converting between shader types will correctly preserve shader parameters.\nThe problem here is that the textures are not shader parameters, they are set directly inside VisualShaderNodeTexture. They don't appear in Shader Parameters list under the material.\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c4e285fa-7383-44d4-8bc6-e83231812cbe\n\nEither VisualShader should properly expose them as properties in the inspector or manually copy over when converting.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582688830/reactions","total_count":4,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582773545","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101375#issuecomment-2582773545","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101375","id":2582773545,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Z8f8p","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-10T13:59:42Z","updated_at":"2025-01-10T13:59:42Z","body":"@KoBeWi I can confirm, changing it to a shader parameter makes the conversion work again! :)  This is a sufficient workaround for our project.  And yes I agree with your proposed solution as well :).  I woke up and was like \"aaahhh I wonder if this is to do with properties.\"  Tested my theory, confirmed, came here to report back my findings, then saw that you beat me to it 😅.\n\nSo with your 2 proposals:\n\n> 1. VisualShader should properly expose them as properties in the inspector\n> 2. manually copy over when converting\n\nI'm perfectly fine with either of these two proposals so long as the values are preserved when converting and the behavior between ``VisualShader`` and ``Shader`` is 1 to 1 (identical) upon conversion.\n\nThanks again for all the help!! :)\n\nShout-out to @arkology as it was your [comment](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101375#issuecomment-2581928891) that inspired me to look at the properties likely being lost :)\n\n@akien-mga @arkology @QbieShay @KoBeWi And throwing love to all of you guys.  Godot, the devs, and the community never fail to impress me and I have absolutely zero regrets migrating out game Blocky Ball to this engine! ♥️","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2582773545/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2658392516","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101375#issuecomment-2658392516","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101375","id":2658392516,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ec9nE","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T06:30:53Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T07:54:21Z","body":"> Converting between shader types will correctly preserve shader parameters. The problem here is that the textures are not shader parameters, they are set directly inside VisualShaderNodeTexture. They don't appear in Shader Parameters list under the material.\n> Either VisualShader should properly expose them as properties in the inspector or manually copy over when converting.\n\nThe problem is that VisualShaderNodeTexture stores the texture and sets default texture parameter at runtime, which cannot be serialized and saved within Shader, because the Shader resource itself only stores code.\n\nI think this can be noted as a limitation in the documentation rather than a bug that if you set a texture in the `VisualShaderNodeTexture`, it will be lost after converting to a shader, otherwise you should use a shader parameter.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2658392516/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659430120","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101375#issuecomment-2659430120","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101375","id":2659430120,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6eg67o","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24307049?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC","html_url":"https://github.com/TCROC","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TCROC/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T14:08:20Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T14:08:20Z","body":"> > Converting between shader types will correctly preserve shader parameters. The problem here is that the textures are not shader parameters, they are set directly inside VisualShaderNodeTexture. They don't appear in Shader Parameters list under the material.\n> > Either VisualShader should properly expose them as properties in the inspector or manually copy over when converting.\n> \n> The problem is that VisualShaderNodeTexture stores the texture and sets default texture parameter at runtime, which cannot be serialized and saved within Shader, because the Shader resource itself only stores code.\n> \n> I think this can be noted as a limitation in the documentation rather than a bug that if you set a texture in the `VisualShaderNodeTexture`, it will be lost after converting to a shader, otherwise you should use a shader parameter.\n\nIs there any reason we can't add support to Shader for storing these things?  That or at export time, convert them to their Parameter equivalent and give them a default value?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659430120/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659488369","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101375#issuecomment-2659488369","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101375","id":2659488369,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ehJJx","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-14T14:32:07Z","updated_at":"2025-02-14T14:32:07Z","body":"Shader is editable text, so it cannot store sub resources. Its parameters are stored in ShaderMaterial","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2659488369/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2660474299","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101375#issuecomment-2660474299","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101375","id":2660474299,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ek527","user":{"login":"TCROC","id":24307049,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0MzA3MDQ5","avatar_ur